# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/launchdek-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`; guard on `typeof launchdekAdmin`.
- REST helpers: `request()`, `get()`, `post()`, `put()`, `del()` — all send `X-WP-Nonce` header.
- DOM helpers: `el( tag, attrs, children )`, `fillSelect( select, items, valueKey, labelKey, placeholder )`; notices via `notice( container, message, type )`.
- Scope queries to `.launchdek-admin` or `[data-launchdek-page]`.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`: set `data-launchdek-ready="true"`, then call all page inits.

### Page init functions

| Function | Page attr | Key elements |
|----------|-----------|--------------|
| `initDashboard()` | `dashboard` | `#launchdek-stats`, `#launchdek-ticker`, `#launchdek-log-feed`, quick launch (`#launchdek-quick-site`, `#launchdek-quick-checklist`, `#launchdek-quick-launch`, `#launchdek-quick-result`); calls `initOnboarding()` for `#launchdek-onboarding-modal` |
| `initSites()` | `sites` | toolbar (`#launchdek-add-site`, `#launchdek-connection-tester`), tag/group filters, `#launchdek-sites-table`, site modal (`#launchdek-site-modal`), standalone connection tester modal |
| `initChecklists()` | `checklists` | `#launchdek-checklist-list`, editor (`#launchdek-checklist-editor`), canvas (`#launchdek-checklist-canvas`, `#launchdek-canvas-steps`), step config (`#launchdek-step-config`), save/export/delete/import controls |
| `initAutomation()` | `automation` | batch queue (`#launchdek-batch-table`, `#launchdek-run-checklist`), run controls (`#launchdek-run-steps`, `#launchdek-run-auto`, `#launchdek-run-next`), audit filters/table (`#launchdek-audit-*`), drift panel (`#launchdek-drift-status`, `#launchdek-verify-drift`) |
| `initTemplates()` | `templates` | category tabs (`#launchdek-category-tabs`, `#launchdek-category-description`), built-in grid (`#launchdek-builtin-templates`), custom checklists (`#launchdek-custom-checklists`), vault save (`#launchdek-vault-checklist`, `#launchdek-save-vault`), vault list (`#launchdek-vault-list`) |
| `initIntegrations()` | `integrations` | Platform Connectors Hub (`#launchdek-connectors-list`, `#launchdek-connector-modal`), telemetry rules (`#launchdek-telemetry-rules-table`, `#launchdek-save-telemetry-rules`) |

Each init no-ops if `[data-launchdek-page="{page}"]` is absent.

### Onboarding helpers (dashboard)

- `parsePastedChecklist( text )` — parses headings, bullets, and numbered lines into `{ title, steps[] }`.
- `buildChecklistPayload( parsed )` — converts parsed steps to manual checklist REST payload.
- `getPasteText()` — returns trimmed textarea value, falling back to placeholder when empty (used for step validation).
- `getPreviewSourceText()` — returns `{ text, isSample }`; when textarea is empty, renders placeholder as a dimmed sample preview (`.is-sample`, disabled checkboxes).
- `updateOnboardingProgress( step )` — toggles `.is-active` / `.is-complete` on `#launchdek-onboarding-progress` segment nodes (`data-step="1|2"`).
- `updateStep2SiteState()` — syncs `#launchdek-onboarding-site` selection with connect panel visibility and connection status.
- `initOnboarding()` — 2-step modal flow:
  - **Step 1** (`#launchdek-onboarding-step-1`): paste SOP text (`#launchdek-onboarding-paste`) → live preview (`#launchdek-onboarding-preview`); placeholder shows sample preview until user types.
  - **Step 2** (`#launchdek-onboarding-step-2`): optional existing-site select (`#launchdek-onboarding-site`) or new-site connect panel (`#launchdek-onboarding-connect-panel`, `/sites/test`, `/sites`) → save checklist (`POST /checklists`) → optional run (`POST /runs`) → dismiss (`POST /onboarding/dismiss`).
  - Shows when `launchdekAdmin.onboarding.show` is true or URL has `?onboarding=1`.

### `launchdekAdmin` shape

```javascript
{
	restUrl: string,    // rest_url( 'launchdek/v1' )
	nonce: string,      // wp_create_nonce( 'wp_rest' )
	adminUrl: string,
	pageSlug: string,
	roles: object,      // WP role slug => translated label (for step target_roles UI)
	onboarding: {
		show: boolean,          // ! onboarding_dismissed
		templatesUrl: string,
		checklistsUrl: string,
		automationUrl: string
	},
	strings: {
		confirmDelete, confirmDeleteSite, saved, error, loading,
		healthOk, healthFail, healthUnknown, connectionOk, connectionFail,
		cloneToChecklist, templateCloned, savedToVault, noVaultTemplates, noCategoryTemplates,
		stepsCount, viewSteps, hideSteps, checklistSteps, stepsPreviewHint,
		connected, notDetected, setup,
		onboardingTitle, onboardingProgressLabel, onboardingStep1, onboardingStep1Hint,
		onboardingStep2, onboardingStep2Hint, onboardingIntro, onboardingPasteLabel,
		onboardingPreviewLabel, onboardingPreviewEmpty, onboardingTestSite, onboardingSelectSite,
		onboardingUseTemplate, onboardingSkip, onboardingNextConnect, onboardingConnectIntro,
		onboardingBack, onboardingLaunch, onboardingOutro, onboardingTestConnection,
		onboardingNeedSteps, onboardingNeedConnection, onboardingExistingSiteReady,
		onboardingStatusConnected, onboardingStatusFailed, onboardingStatusPending, onboardingStatusTesting
	}
}
```

## CSS (`admin/css/launchdek-admin.css`)

Prefix all selectors with `.launchdek-`.

| Class | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `.launchdek-admin` | Page root wrapper (`data-launchdek-ready` set on DOMContentLoaded) |
| `.launchdek-card` | Content card |
| `.launchdek-stats-grid`, `.launchdek-stat-card`, `.launchdek-stat-value`, `.launchdek-stat-label` | Dashboard stats |
| `.launchdek-quick-launch`, `.launchdek-inline-form` | Quick launch bar and inline forms |
| `.launchdek-sites-toolbar`, `.launchdek-sites-toolbar-actions`, `.launchdek-sites-toolbar-filters` | Sites page toolbar and filters |
| `.launchdek-ticker-inline`, `.launchdek-ticker-chip`, `.launchdek-ticker-sep`, `.launchdek-ticker-dot` | Connection ticker (`#launchdek-ticker`) |
| `.launchdek-log-feed`, `.launchdek-log-item` | Activity feed (`#launchdek-log-feed`) |
| `.launchdek-badge`, `.launchdek-tag` | Site health / tags |
| `.launchdek-modal`, `.launchdek-modal-backdrop`, `.launchdek-modal-content`, `.launchdek-modal-actions` | Modals (`[hidden]` when closed) |
| `.launchdek-onboarding-modal`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress-segments`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress-segment`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress-segment-bar`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress-segment-text`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress-segment-label`, `.launchdek-onboarding-progress-segment-hint` | Segmented 2-step progress (`#launchdek-onboarding-progress`); modifiers `.is-active`, `.is-complete` on segments |
| `.launchdek-onboarding-columns`, `.launchdek-onboarding-preview`, `.launchdek-onboarding-preview.is-sample`, `.launchdek-onboarding-connect-panel`, `.launchdek-onboarding-test-status`, `.launchdek-onboarding-optional`, `.launchdek-onboarding-existing-site` | Dashboard onboarding modal (`#launchdek-onboarding-modal`) |
| `.launchdek-list` | Selectable lists |
| `.launchdek-builder-layout`, `.launchdek-builder-workspace` | Checklist builder layout |
| `.launchdek-canvas-card`, `.launchdek-checklist-canvas`, `.launchdek-canvas-flow` | Drag-and-drop checklist canvas |
| `.launchdek-canvas-node`, `.launchdek-canvas-node-roles`, `.launchdek-canvas-connector` | Canvas step nodes + role badges + flow arrows |
| `.launchdek-step-config-sidebar`, `.launchdek-role-mapping`, `.launchdek-role-option` | Step config panel + role target mapping |
| `.launchdek-target-selector`, `.launchdek-batch-queue`, `.launchdek-automation-layout` | Automation run/batch UI |
| `.launchdek-run-steps`, `.launchdek-run-step` | Run step tracker |
| `.launchdek-audit-filters`, `.launchdek-audit-diff` | Audit log filters + drift diff display |
| `.launchdek-drift-sites`, `.launchdek-drift-site-row` | Drift status panel |
| `.launchdek-category-tabs`, `.launchdek-category-tab` | Template category tab bar (`#launchdek-category-tabs`) |
| `.launchdek-template-grid`, `.launchdek-template-card`, `.launchdek-template-card-actions` | Built-in and vault template cards |
| `.launchdek-template-steps-preview`, `.launchdek-template-steps-toggle`, `.launchdek-template-steps-list` | Step preview on template cards (hover or toggle) |
| `.launchdek-connector-list`, `.launchdek-connector-row`, `.launchdek-connector-actions` | Platform Connectors Hub |
| `#launchdek-telemetry-rules-table` | Telemetry sync mapping rules table |
| `.launchdek-integration-card` | Legacy integration card style (prefer connector list) |
| `.launchdek-import-export` | Checklist import/export controls |
| `.launchdek-settings-*` | Settings page cards, toggles, channels, role presets, perm table |
| `.launchdek-notice-area .notice-inline` | Inline success/error |
| `.launchdek-grid-2` | Two-column layout |
| `.launchdek-select`, `.launchdek-muted` | Form controls |

Status modifiers: `.healthy`, `.unhealthy`, `.unknown`, `.active`, `.success`, `.error`. Run steps: `.status-completed`, `.status-failed`, `.status-awaiting_manual`, `.status-running`.

## Partials (`admin/partials/`)

Thin shells only — no business logic. Each sets `data-launchdek-page` on `.launchdek-admin` root (including `settings`). Settings page uses Settings API form, not REST-driven CRUD.

## Enqueuing

| Handle | File | When |
|--------|------|------|
| `launchdek-admin` (style) | `admin/css/launchdek-admin.css` | `is_plugin_screen()` |
| `launchdek-admin` (script) | `admin/js/launchdek-admin.js` | `is_plugin_screen()` + `wp_localize_script` |

Version: `filemtime()` when file exists, otherwise `LAUNCHDEK_VERSION`.
